<title>USA: Labor Ready to take $1.9 million charge.</title>
<headline>Labor Ready to take $1.9 million charge.</headline>
<dateline>TACOMA, Wash. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Labor Ready Inc said on Tuesday it would take a $1.9 million pre-tax charge in the third quarter as a result of prepayment of its $10 million 13 percent senior subordinated notes.</p>
</text>
